#: ui/appearance.slint:75
msgid "For bright rooms; the video area stays dark"
msgstr "适合明亮环境；视频区保持深色"

#: ui/appearance.slint:75
msgid "Default, from the logo's aurora colours"
msgstr "默认，取自标志的极光色谱"

#: ui/appearance.slint:91
