#: ui/appearance.slint:144
msgid "Changes apply to every window at once. Corner radii, font sizes and control sizes stay the same in every palette."
msgstr "切换后所有窗口立即生效。圆角、字号与控件尺寸不随配色变化。"

#: ui/appearance.slint:154
